* TLV75733P (TI), LDO 3.3 V 1 A - modelo conductual: salida 3.3 V, dropout ~0.4 V a 1 A
* (lineal con la corriente), Iq 25 uA, habilitado si EN > 0.9 V. Pines: IN GND EN OUT.
.subckt TLV75733P IN GND EN OUT
Iq IN GND 25u
B1 OI GND V=if(V(EN,GND)>0.9, min(3.3, V(IN,GND)-0.4*abs(I(VS))), 0)
VS OI OUT 0
RS OUT GND 10Meg
.ends TLV75733P
